cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MCP Legal Agent: A Controllable Legal-Retrieval Agent with Stateless MCP Tools"
abstract: >-
  A controllable legal-retrieval agent that links a case fact to the statutes
  that plausibly apply. Retrieval is hybrid (BM25 + vector recall fused with
  Reciprocal Rank Fusion); every candidate is verified against the original fact
  before it can appear in the answer, and the agent abstains when evidence is
  insufficient. The retrieval-and-verification tool is stateless and is callable
  both directly and over the Model Context Protocol (MCP) stdio transport.
authors:
  - name: "MCP Legal Agent contributors"
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
repository-code: "https://github.com/<you>/mcp-legal-agent"
keywords:
  - legal retrieval
  - model context protocol
  - mcp
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - hybrid retrieval
  - reciprocal rank fusion
  - grounded generation